# m7_power (M7 power loss, PLAN.md M7 "Player"): a hit that triggers the auto rewind costs one
# weapon level (never below 1) and one fork (never below 0) at the resume, plus 80 mercy;
# hold-B rewinds and the retry shield cost no power. Input: m6_retry's sweep (god mode from
# 31 to collect power, forks and the shield; god off at 5000), plus a hold-B at 5040..5049.
# Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (waves.zig: the stage clock runs 4 ticks a tick while fewer
# than 3 enemies are on the field): the sweep now kills the Heisenbug by 3908 and is in stage
# 2 (INTEGRATION) at 5000 with B5 (weapon 25), three forks and the shield, and its waves hit
# the ship without help, so m6_retry's RIGHT 5150..5200 into the Heisenbug is gone (it fell
# in a rewind playback and changed nothing) and the hold moved from 5100 to 5040, after the
# first shield block. Three forks at 5000, so the fork floor is not reached here (m7_rank's
# resumes at forks 0 pin it).
# Re-pinned for the mode paces (NORMAL: the table clock hurries, 3 ticks a tick, only on an
# empty field; the fire ramp counts real ticks): the stages run longer again, so at 5000 the
# idle ship (the sweep ends at 3960) is in the Heisenbug's fight (spawned 3604) with A5
# (weapon 15, from 3608), three forks and the shield; the input is unchanged and the run grows
# from 5750 to 6000 updates. The first rewind's target is after the shield block, so its
# playback does not bring the shield back (under the catch-up clock every rewind did); the
# second goes back past the first resume instead, which shows that the cost is World state.
# - 5004 (tick 4897): the retry shield absorbs a hit: shield 0, still A5 and three forks.
# - Hold-B 5040..5049 (20 ticks, fuel 180 -> 160): A5 and three forks before, during (5049,
#   tick 4912) and after the release (5050): no cost.
# - 5451 (tick 5313): hit, auto rewind to 5193 (rewinds 2). The playback frames show the
#   World of then (5530: A5, forks 3); the resume at 5531 charges the cost: A5 -> A4 (weapon
#   15 -> 14), forks 3 -> 2, mercy 0 -> 80.
# - 5629 (tick 5291): hit (rewinds 1), target 5171, before the last resume: the playback
#   undoes its cost (5698: A5, forks 3, mercy 0 again), and the resume at 5709 at tick 5171
#   charges one level and one fork once more: A4, forks 2, mercy 80.
# - 5829 (tick 5291 again): hit (rewinds 0), resume at 5909 at tick 5171, the World of the
#   last resume (5908: A4, forks 2, mercy 80): A4 -> A3, forks 2 -> 1, mercy 80 -> 160. The
#   run stops at 6000: the next hit (6037) has no rewind left and ends the game.
# (Under the catch-up clock: B5 at 5000, shield block at 5011, hits at 5126, 5350 and 5554,
# each resume after a restored shield, B2 and mercy 239 at the end.)
# m6_retry_hc pins the same cost in a hardcore game. debug_history_check is 0 after each
# resume and during the hold.
--frames 6000 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "5000 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_rewinds,debug_mercy --at "3608 debug_weapon == 15" --at "5000 debug_boss_id == 0" --at "5003 debug_shield == 1" --at "5004 debug_shield == 0" --at "5004 debug_state == 1" --at "5004 debug_weapon == 15" --at "5004 debug_forks == 3" --at "5039 debug_weapon == 15" --at "5039 debug_forks == 3" --at "5040 debug_state == 5" --at "5049 debug_state == 5" --at "5049 debug_game_tick == 4912" --at "5049 debug_weapon == 15" --at "5049 debug_forks == 3" --at "5049 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5050 debug_state == 1" --at "5050 debug_weapon == 15" --at "5050 debug_forks == 3" --at "5050 debug_fuel == 160" --at "5050 debug_mercy == 0" --at "5450 debug_state == 1" --at "5451 debug_state == 4" --at "5451 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "5451 debug_rewind_target == 5193" --at "5530 debug_state == 4" --at "5530 debug_weapon == 15" --at "5530 debug_forks == 3" --at "5531 debug_state == 1" --at "5531 debug_game_tick == 5193" --at "5531 debug_weapon == 14" --at "5531 debug_forks == 2" --at "5531 debug_mercy == 80" --at "5540 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5629 debug_state == 4" --at "5629 debug_rewinds == 1" --at "5629 debug_rewind_target == 5171" --at "5697 debug_weapon == 14" --at "5698 debug_weapon == 15" --at "5698 debug_forks == 3" --at "5698 debug_mercy == 0" --at "5709 debug_state == 1" --at "5709 debug_game_tick == 5171" --at "5709 debug_weapon == 14" --at "5709 debug_forks == 2" --at "5709 debug_mercy == 80" --at "5720 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5829 debug_state == 4" --at "5829 debug_rewinds == 0" --at "5908 debug_weapon == 14" --at "5908 debug_mercy == 80" --at "5909 debug_state == 1" --at "5909 debug_game_tick == 5171" --at "5909 debug_weapon == 13" --at "5909 debug_forks == 1" --at "5909 debug_mercy == 160" --at "5920 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5999 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_weapon == 13"
